<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Did I somehow give it away? There's no cram school starting at this hour, is there!<STYLE ID="1"> </STYLE>Operation failed..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Now that she mentioned it, cram school from 2 p.m. is far too early for a high school student.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"The cram school was a lie! So I'm staying with you, all right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="1"> was looking straight at me with a bright, clear face.</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "70" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, may I intrude on your home as well?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah! </STYLE>You<STYLE ID="2">, I was thinking of calling you if you were free."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ehehe, yes!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Goto<STYLE ID="1"> climbed happily onto her bicycle.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Somehow, I was hugely relieved.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It felt as though this would let me avoid a great danger.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Only a feeling, that was all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Whether the danger could really be avoided, or whether any danger had been about to happen at all, there was no proof of it anywhere.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物3,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\能面フラッシュ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">But, what was it that I had seen just now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A mask... maybe?</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
